description: Markdown style for the guide, docs, and deploy notes
globs: docs/**/*.md, README.md, AGENTS.md, DEPLOYMENT.md, deploy/**/*.md
alwaysApply: false
---

# Documentation

- Short sections. Use a list or a table when it is easier to scan.
- Plain words. An emoji only when it helps someone scan, such as an issue title.
- Relative links, and only paths that exist. Link to a longer page instead of copying it.
- The root README is for visitors. Operator steps stay in `DEPLOYMENT.md`. This guide stays in `AGENTS.md`.
- Do not link companion repos that sit outside this public demo.
- Add a diagram only when a flow is hard to follow in a short list.
